<title>PHILIPPINES: Universal says 1996 net 414 million pesos.</title>
<headline>Universal says 1996 net 414 million pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Rightfield Property Holdings Inc said on Tuesday its 1996 net income surged to 414 million pesos against the previous year's 28 million pesos.</p>
<p>Assistant corporate secretary Ma. Lourdes Gonzales said in a statement earnings per share of the company reached 20 centavos from one centavo IN 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;Of the 414 million net income, 123 million pesos was caused before the May 3, 1996 merger of the company with Rightfield Property Ventures Inc,&quot; Gonzales said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
